3bc1351" :question/math-academy-id "q-123285" :question/problem "Find $|r(3)|$ given that $r(t)=⟨2t-4,\\,\\sqrt{6t+7},\\,\\sqrt{t+4}⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Evaluating the function at $t=3,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(3) & =⟨2(3)-4,\\,\\sqrt{6(3)+7},\\,\\sqrt{3+4}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,5,\\,\\sqrt{7}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(3)| & =\\sqrt{{(2)}^{2}+{(5)}^{2}+(\\sqrt{7})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+25+7} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{36} \\\\  & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123285/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e520dc67-3b63-5ca7-959b-f642d85529d6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123285"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-348653/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "cb99fbc0-cac6-5d79-8483-1e314a68a64d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-348653/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "acad7e81-2df5-5191-a997-b46b35c6c207" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-348653/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "a49a9290-7812-55be-9a88-6eed227a2e12" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-348653/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-348653/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-348653/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-348653/field-2/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "12c064f4-ed8a-56b0-a62b-165483d1480c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:d